{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Quiet Night at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Feeling Nostalgic", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>When you want to clarify which person or thing you are talking about, you use a relative clause.</p><p>You can begin a relative clause with <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.</p>You put the relative clause immediately after the noun it talks about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A subject relative clause describes the subject of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An object relative clause describes the object of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Connector</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Type of Relative Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The consummate college rom com that takes you back.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that takes you back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The one who walked out on her!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who walked out on her\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She could never live up to his expectations, which were totally unreal.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which were totally unreal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She runs into him at the coffee shop that he goes to all the time.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that he goes to all the time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He finds out about the guy that she used to be with.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that she used to be with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish it were all that easy!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it's not that easy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If having it all were so easy, everyone would be happy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"everyone is not happy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If college was actually like they showed it in the movies, it would be a snap!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"college is not like they show it in the movies\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I could just go back for a few days and enjoy it all again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't go back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I were young again like those kids in the movie!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not young like the kids in the movie\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rom com", "type": "name"}, {"content": "romantic comedy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love watching rom coms!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about relationships.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "consummate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "perfect in every way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That was the consummate college rom com!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to team up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to work together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"conte