, "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I wish it were all that easy!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I do too. If having it all were so easy, everyone would be happy.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If college was actually like they showed it in the movies, it would be a snap!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wish I could just go back for a few days and enjoy it all again.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If I'm not mistaken, Peter had a crush on you early on.", "id": 2, "time": "22700", "image": "engenn7le13ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's not go there. Please. I have to say, he was the one who made me feel comfortable here in Cambridge. He took me out to eat, to concerts and to the comic book store!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He's just one of those guys who make great friends!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, it's still early. We could give him a call and see what he's up to! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Great idea!", "id": 3, "time": "43500", "image": "engenn7le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le13ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}